{"sectionId":"respiratory/ventilation","items":[{"id":"respiratory--ventilation-k001","sectionId":"respiratory/ventilation","unitId":"respiratory","subject":"biology","text":"흡기 시 횡격막 수축으로 흉강 용적이 증가하고 폐포압이 대기압보다","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"respiratory--ventilation-k002","sectionId":"respiratory/ventilation","unitId":"respiratory","subject":"biology","text":"낮아져 공기가 유입된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"respiratory--ventilation-k003","sectionId":"respiratory/ventilation","unitId":"respiratory","subject":"biology","text":"흉막강 압력과 폐포압 차인 transpulmonary pressure는 폐 팽창과 관련된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"respiratory--ventilation-k004","sectionId":"respiratory/ventilation","unitId":"respiratory","subject":"biology","text":"surfactant는 제II형 폐포세포에서 분비되어 표면장력을 낮춘다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"respiratory--ventilation-k005","sectionId":"respiratory/ventilation","unitId":"respiratory","subject":"biology","text":"폐포 환기량은 (일회호흡량−사강량)×호흡수이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"respiratory--ventilation-k006","sectionId":"respiratory/ventilation","unitId":"respiratory","subject":"biology","text":"기체 확산량은 Fick 법칙에 따라 면적과 분압차에 비례하고 장벽 두께에 반비례한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"respiratory--ventilation-k007","sectionId":"respiratory/ventilation","unitId":"respiratory","subject":"biology","text":"산소는 대부분 Hb 결합 형태로 운반되고 CO₂는 주로 bicarbonate 형태 및 용해·carbamino 형태로 운반된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"respiratory--ventilation-k008","sectionId":"respiratory/ventilation","unitId":"respiratory","subject":"biology","text":"적혈구 carbonic anhydrase가 CO₂ 수화반응을 촉진하며 chloride shift가 전하 균형에 관여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"respiratory--ventilation-k009","sectionId":"respiratory/ventilation","unitId":"respiratory","subject":"biology","text":"Haldane 효과는 산소화 Hb의 CO₂ 및 H⁺ 운반능 감소를 설명한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"respiratory--ventilation-k010","sectionId":"respiratory/ventilation","unitId":"respiratory","subject":"biology","text":"환기-관류 불균형은 저산소혈증을 일으킬 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"respiratory--ventilation-k011","sectionId":"respiratory/ventilation","unitId":"respiratory","subject":"biology","text":"중추 화학수용기는 주로 CO₂에 의한 뇌척수액 pH 변화를, 말초 화학수용기는 저산소·CO₂·pH 변화 등을 감지한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"respiratory--ventilation-k012","sectionId":"respiratory/ventilation","unitId":"respiratory","subject":"biology","text":"폐포 환기=(VT−VD)×f.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"respiratory--ventilation-k013","sectionId":"respiratory/ventilation","unitId":"respiratory","subject":"biology","text":"제I형 폐포세포: 가스교환, 제II형: surfactant 및 재생.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"respiratory--ventilation-k014","sectionId":"respiratory/ventilation","unitId":"respiratory","subject":"biology","text":"Bohr 효과와 Haldane 효과를 구별한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"respiratory--ventilation-k015","sectionId":"respiratory/ventilation","unitId":"respiratory","subject":"biology","text":"과환기는 PaCO₂ 감소와 호흡성 알칼리증 방향으로 작용한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"respiratory--ventilation-k016","sectionId":"respiratory/ventilation","unitId":"respiratory","subject":"biology","text":"4.2 L/min이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}